npm dependencies bundled into the build are listed with their licenses in
dist/LICENSES.md, generated by `npm run build`:

  pdfjs-dist (PDF.js), Apache License 2.0, Mozilla Foundation
  page-flip (StPageFlip), MIT License, Oleg Litovski
  lucide (toolbar icons), ISC License, Lucide Contributors

PDF.js fonts, cmaps, CMYK ICC profile and WebAssembly modules are copied to dist/pdfjs/ together
with their own LICENSE_* files.

Code taken from outside npm:

  src/textlayer.css is the .textLayer section of pdfjs-dist/web/pdf_viewer.css,
  Apache License 2.0, Mozilla Foundation.

  test/tracemonkey.pdf is web/compressed.tracemonkey-pldi-09.pdf from the
  PDF.js repository (https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js), used as a test file.
